#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Readout error {#readout-error}"
msgstr "Ralat bacaan {#readout-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Classical readout errors are specified by a list of assignment probability "
"vectors $P(A|B)$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ralat bacaan klasikal ditentukan oleh senarai vektor kebarangkalian tugasan "
"$P(A|B)$:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$A$ is the *recorded* classical bit value\n"
msgstr "$A$ ialah nilai bit klasikal yang *direkod*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$B$ is the *true* bit value returned from the measurement\n"
msgstr "$B$ ialah nilai bit *sebenar* yang dikembalikan daripada pengukuran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For example, for one qubit: $ P(A|B) = [P(A|0), P(A|1)]$.\n"
msgstr "Contohnya, untuk satu qubit: $ P(A|B) = [P(A|0), P(A|1)]$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Readout errors may also be combined using `compose`, `tensor` and `expand`, "
"like with quantum errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ralat bacaan juga boleh digabungkan menggunakan `compose`, `tensor` dan "
"`expand`, sama seperti ralat kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add errors to a noise model {#add-errors-to-a-noise-model}"
msgstr "Tambah ralat pada model hingar {#add-errors-to-a-noise-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When adding a quantum error to a noise model, we must specify the type of "
"*instruction* that it acts on and what qubits to apply it to. There are two "
"cases of quantum errors:\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila menambah ralat kuantum pada model hingar, kita perlu menentukan "
"jenis *arahan* yang ia bertindak ke atasnya dan qubit mana yang hendak "
"digunakan. Terdapat dua kes ralat kuantum:\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' 1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "All-qubit quantum error\n"
msgstr "Ralat kuantum semua qubit\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' 2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specific qubit quantum error\n"
msgstr "Ralat kuantum qubit tertentu\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. All-qubit quantum error {#1-all-qubit-quantum-error}"
msgstr "1. Ralat kuantum semua qubit {#1-all-qubit-quantum-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This applies the same error to any occurrence of an instruction, regardless "
"of which qubits it acts on.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini menerapkan ralat yang sama pada setiap kemunculan sesuatu arahan, tanpa "
"mengira qubit mana yang ia bertindak ke atasnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is added as `noise_model.add_all_qubit_quantum_error(error, "
"instructions)`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ia ditambah sebagai `noise_model.add_all_qubit_quantum_error(error, "
"instructions)`:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Specific qubit quantum error {#2-specific-qubit-quantum-error}"
msgstr "2. Ralat kuantum qubit tertentu {#2-specific-qubit-quantum-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This applies the error to any occurrence of an instruction acting on a "
"specified list of qubits. Note that the order of the qubit matters: for "
"example, an error applied to qubits [0, 1] for a two-qubit gate is different"
" to one applied to qubits [1, 0].\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini menerapkan ralat pada setiap kemunculan arahan yang bertindak ke atas "
"senarai qubit yang ditetapkan. Perlu diambil perhatian bahawa susunan qubit "
"adalah penting: sebagai contoh, ralat yang digunakan pada qubit [0, 1] untuk"
" get dua-qubit adalah berbeza dengan ralat pada qubit [1, 0].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is added as `noise_model.add_quantum_error(error, instructions, "
"qubits)`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ia ditambah sebagai `noise_model.add_quantum_error(error, instructions, "
"qubits)`:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note on non-local qubit quantum error {#note-on-non-local-qubit-quantum-"
"error}"
msgstr ""
"Nota mengenai ralat kuantum qubit bukan setempat {#note-on-non-local-qubit-"
"quantum-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseModel` does not support addition of non-local qubit quantum errors. "
"They should be handled outside of `NoiseModel`. That suggests you should "
"[write your own transpiler pass](/guides/custom-transpiler-pass) "
"(`TransformationPass`) and run the pass just before running the simulator if"
" you need to insert your quantum errors into your circuit under your own "
"conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseModel` tidak menyokong penambahan ralat kuantum qubit bukan setempat. "
"Ralat-ralat ini perlu dikendalikan di luar `NoiseModel`. Ini bermakna anda "
"perlu [menulis laluan transpiler anda sendiri](/guides/custom-transpiler-"
"pass) (`TransformationPass`) dan menjalankan laluan tersebut sejurus sebelum"
" menjalankan simulator jika anda perlu memasukkan ralat kuantum ke dalam "
"litar anda mengikut syarat-syarat anda sendiri.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Execute a noisy simulation with a noise model {#execute-a-noisy-simulation-"
"with-a-noise-model}"
msgstr ""
"Laksanakan simulasi berbising dengan model hingar {#execute-a-noisy-"
"simulation-with-a-noise-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command `AerSimulator(noise_model=noise_model)` returns a simulator "
"configured to the given noise model. In addition to setting the simulator's "
"noise model, it also overrides the simulator's basis gates, according to the"
" gates of the noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Arahan `AerSimulator(noise_model=noise_model)` mengembalikan simulator yang "
"dikonfigurasikan mengikut model hingar yang diberikan. Selain menetapkan "
"model hingar simulator, ia juga mengatasi get-get asas simulator, mengikut "
"get-get dalam model hingar.\n"

